OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright to end the day. However, cloud
OL,7,Fwill gradually increase from the
OL,8,Fnorthwest overnight with rain
OL,9,Fbeginning to edge in from the north.
OL,10,FThe south of the region should remain
OL,11,Flargely dry overnight. Warm and humid.
OL,12,
OL,13,CFriday:FCloud and outbreaks of rain,
OL,14,Flocally heavy, will gradually clear
OL,15,Fsoutheastwards during the morning.
OL,16,FDrier and brighter skies following.
OL,17,FFeeling fresher, but still pleasant in
OL,18,Fthe sunshine. Breezy.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
